    <briefdescription>
<para>Define sets of equivalent and exclusive particles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is equivalent to having both an <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1EquivalenceSubsetFilterTable" kindref="compound">EquivalenceSubsetFilterTable</ref> and an <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ExclusionSubsetFilterTable" kindref="compound">ExclusionSubsetFilterTable</ref> on the same particles, but faster. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
